<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="2.0">
  <book code="REV" style="id">Biathlam</book>
  <para style="h">Biathlam</para>
  <para style="toc1">Biathlam</para>
  <para style="toc2">Biathlam</para>
  <para style="mt">Biathlam</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi cauk hi Jesuh Khrih nih a phuanmi thil kong a si. Cu a phuanmi cu a um zau dingmi thil, Pathian nih a sal hna hmuhsak awkah a pekmi kha a si. Cu thil hna cu Khrih nih a sal Johan kha a hngalhter i cu hngalhtertu ah cun a vancungmi kha a thlah i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Johan nih cun a hmuhmi thil vialte cu a chim dih. Pathian sinin hmuhmi bia le Jesuh Khrih nih a phuanmi biatak Johan nih a chim chinmi cu hihi a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Hi cauk a relmi le hi profet bia a ngai i hi cauk chung i aa ṭialmi a zulmi cu lunglawmmi an si. Zeicahtiah hi thil vialte a tlin lai caan cu a naite cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asia peng chung i a ummi Khrihfabu pasarih kha Johan nih bia kan cah hna: Atu i a um liomi le a rak um cangmi le a um lai ding a simi Pathian le a bawiṭhutdan hmai i a ummi thlarau pasarih le Jesuh Khrih nih vel le daihnak in pe ko hna seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Jesuh Khrih cu zumh awk a tlakmi tehte, hrin hmasa bikmi Fapa, thihnak in thawhter a simi a si i vawlei cung siangpahrang hna a uktu zong a si fawn. Kannih cu a kan dawt i a thihnak thawngin kan sualnak chung khan a kan chuah i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />a Pathian le a Pa rian kha tlangbawi bantukin a ṭuantu dingah siangpahrang phun ah a kan ser. Cu Jesuh cungah cun sunparnak le ṭhawnnak kha zungzal in zungzal tiang um camcin ko seh! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Zohhmanh u, khuadawm sin khin a ra lio! Mi kip nih an hmuh lai, a rak chuntu hna zong nih khan an hmuh lai. Cun vawlei cung mi vialte cu a cung i an rak tuahmi kha i ngaichih in an ṭap lai. Cu ti hrimhrim cun a si lai! Amen.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Lianngan Bik Bawipa Pathian nih cun, “Kei cu Alfa le Omega ka si,” a ti, cu Pathian a um liomi le a um cangmi le a um laimi cu, zeizong vialte siangpahrang Bawipa a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Kei cu nan unau Johan kha ka si. Jesuh ah kan i pehtlaihnak thawngin hremnak nan innak ah ka ing ve, nan umnak a Pennak chungah khan ka um ve i temhinnak nan inmi kha ka ing ve. Pathian bia ka chim ca le Jesuh nih a phuanmi biatak ka phuan ruangah, Patmos tikulh ah khan an ka chiah.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Bawipa Ni ah Thlarau nih a ka tlak i ka hnulei in aw thangpi pakhat kha ka theih, cu aw cu muko aw thawng bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A ka thawh i, “Na hmuhmi kha ṭial law na ṭialnak cauk cu Khrihfabu pasarih kha kua hna: cu Khrihfabu hna cu Efesa khua le Smyrna khua le Pergamum khua le Thiatira khua le Sardis khua le Filadelfia khua le Laodisia khua i a ummi kha an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A ka chawntu cu ahodah a si hnga tiah ka hun i mer i cuka ah cun sui mei vannak pasarih ka hmuh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cu mei vannak hna lakah cun minung a lomi pakhat a dir i a kemit phiak in angki fual aa hruk i a ṭang ah sui taisawm pakhat aa sawmh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />A sam cu tuuhmul bantuk a si i hawhra bantukin a rang i a mit cu mei bantukin a alh;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />a ke cu somei chungah an tit i tleu tein an hnormi dar bantukin a tleu i a aw cu tisor nganpi thawng bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A orhlei kut in arfi pasarih aa put hna i a ka chungin kap hnih in a harmi nam a chuak. A hmai cu chunlai ni ceu bantukin a ceu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Amah cu ka hmuh tikah mithi bantukin a ke hramah ka tlu. A orhlei kut in a vun ka tawngh i, “Na thinphang hlah! Kei cu hmasa bik le hmanung bik kha ka si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Kei cu a nungmi kha ka si. Ka rak thi, sihmanhsehlaw zohhmanh, zungzal in zungzal tiang ka nung cang. Thihnak cung le mithikhua cungah nawl ka ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cucaah cun na hmuhmi thil, atu i a um liomi thil hna le hmailei ah a um lai dingmi thil hna kha ṭial hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ka orhlei kut i na hmuhmi arfi pasarih hna le sui mei vannak pasarih hna an sullam biathli cu hihi a si: arfi pasarih hi Khrihfabu hna i an vancungmi kha an si i mei vannak pasarih hna hi Khrihfabu pasarih hna kha an si,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Efesa khua i a ummi Khrihfabu vancungmi sinah hitihin va ṭial tuah: A orhlei kut in arfi pasarih aa put i sui mei vannak pasarih hna lakah aa chawkmi bia cu hihi a si:
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Na tuahmi kha ka hngalh ko; zeitluk in dah naa zuam le zeitluk in dah lungsau in na um kha ka hngalh. Mi ṭhalo na in khawh hna lo kha ka hngalh i lamkaltu an si na loin lamkaltu kan si aa timi hna na hneksak hna le milip an si na hliah khawh kha ka hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Na lung a sau, keimah ruangah harnak na in i na lung a dong lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw ka lung na si lonak a um: cucu hmasa i na rak ka dawt bantuk khan na ka daw ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zeitluk niam i na tlak cang kha philh hlah. Na sualnak kha mertak hna law hmasa i na rak tuah tawnmi kha tuah ṭhan hna. Na sualnak kha na mertak hna lo ahcun, ka ra lai i na mei vannak kha a umnak hmun in ka ṭhial lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw hi ṭhatnak hi na ngei, cucu Nikolas zultu pawl nih an tuahmi kha keimah nih ka huat tlukin na huat ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Hna nan ngeih ahcun, Thlarau nih Khrihfabu hna sinah a chimmi bia cu ngai ko u! Teitu a simi cu, Pathian Dum chung i a ummi nunnak thingkung theitlai einak nawl kha ka pek hna lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />“Smyrna khua i a ummi Khrihfabu vancungmi sinah hitihin va ṭial tuah: Hi bia hi a hmasa bik le a hmanung bik a simi, a thi i a nung ṭhanmi bia a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Na harnak kha ka hngalh ko hna; sifak na si kha ka hngalh — sihmanhsehlaw a ngaingai ti ahcun a rummi na si. Judah mi a si lo nain Judah mi ka si aa timi hna nih an in thangchiatnak kha ka hngalh; annih cu Satan ta a simi bu an si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Sifahnak na in dingmi kha zeihmanh ṭih hna hlah. Hi bia hi ngai hmanh. Khuachia nih khan nangmah hneksaknak caah nanmah lak i a cheu cu thong ah a thlak hna lai; harnak na inmi cu ni hra chung a si lai. Thih tiangin ka cungah zumhawktlak tein um ko; cun nunnak suiluchin kha kan pek lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Hna nan ngeih ahcun, Thlarau nih Khrihfabu hna sinah a chimmi bia kha ngai ko u! “Teitu a simi cu thih hnihnak nih harnak a pe kho hna lai lo,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Pergamum khua i a ummi Khrihfabu vancungmi sinah hitihin va ṭial tuah: “Hi bia hi vainam kap hnih har a ngeimi bia kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Na umnak hmun kha ka hngalh; Satan nih a bawiṭhutdan a chiahnak hmun a si kha ka hngalh. Ka cungah zumhawktlak in na um i keimah ca i zumhawktlak a simi tehte Antipas kha Satan umnak hmun i an thah ah khan, na zumhnak cu na ṭhial tak hlei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Asinain na cungah ka lungtlin lonak tlawmpalte a um: cucu Balaam cawnpiaknak a zulmi nan lakah tlawmpal an um kha a si; Balaam nih cun Balak kha, Israel mi cu siasal pekmi rawl einak thawng le nu le pa sualnak thawngin an sual nakhnga, na cawnpiak hna lai, tiah a cawnpiak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun nan lakah Nikolas zultu pawl cawnpiaknak a zulmi zong nan um fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Nan i mer lo ahcun nan sinah ka ra zau lai i ka kaa chungin a chuakmi vainam khan kha mi hna kha ka tuk sual hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“Hna nan ngeih ahcun Thlarau nih Khrihfabu sinah a chimmi bia cu ngai tuah u. “Teitu a simi hna cu thuhmi manna changreu kha tlawmpal in ka pek hna lai. Cun lung rang zong pakhat cio in ka pek hna lai i cu lung cungah cun a cotu cio lawng nih a sullam an hngalhmi min thar kha an i ṭial cio,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Thiatira khua i a ummi Khrihfabu vancungmi sinah hi bangin va ṭial tuah: Hi bia hi Pathian Fapa, a mit mei alh bantukin a alhmi le a ke dar tleu bantukin a tleumi bia a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Na tuahmi kha ka hngalh. Dawtnak na ngeihmi le zumhawktlak na sinak le na rianṭuanmi le na lungsaunak kha ka hngalh hna. A hramthawk ah na rak tuahmi nakin atu ah tam deuh na tuah ti kha ka hngalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw na cung i ka lungtlin lonak cu hihi a si. Pathian lamkaltu ka si, aa timi Jezebel kha na dawn lo. Amah nih cun ka salle kha a cawnpiak hna i a ping ah a hruai hna i nu le pa sualnak kha an tuah i siasal pekchanhmi rawl kha an ei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Lungthlennak caan kha ka pek ko, sihmanhsehlaw a horduhcuainak lam khan i let ṭhan a duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Cucaah ihkhun cungah ka hlonh lai i cu ihkhun cungah cun amah le amah he nu le pa sualnak a tuahmi kha fak piin temhnak an ing lai. Amah he ṭhat lonak an tuahmi kha an i ngaihchih lo ahcun, atu ah hi temhnak hi an cungah ka tlunter ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Cun a zultu hna zong kha ka thah hna lai i Khrihfabu vialte nih khan keimah cu minung lungthin le duhnak a hngal dihtu ka si kha an hngalh lai. Nannih cu nan tuahmi ning cio ah kan cham hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw Thiatira khua i a ummi a dang nih cun hi cawnpiaknak ṭhalo cu nan zul lo i midang nih, “Satan biathli thuk,” an timi cu nan hngal lo. Nannih cungah cun thilrit khinh kan duh hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw atu i nan ngeihmi kha ka rat tiang fek tein rak i tlaih ko u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Teitu a simi hna le tuah hna seh ti ka duhmi a dongh tiangin a tuahmi hna cu, ka Pa sinin ka hmuhmi nawl ngeihnak kha annih zong ka pek ve hna lai. Miphun dang uknak nawl kha ka pek hna lai i annih cu thirfung in uknak nawl le tlak-um bangin khuainak nawl kha ka pek hna lai. Cun deirel arfi zong kha ka pek hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" />“Hna nan ngeih ahcun, Thlarau nih Khrihfabu hna sinah a chimmi bia kha ngai tuah u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />“Sardis khua i a ummi Khrihfabu vancungmi sinah hi bangin va ṭial tuah: Hi bia hi Pathian thlarau pasarih le arfi pasarih a ngeimi bia kha a si. Na tuahmi kha ka hngalh, a nungmi a si tiah na min a thang nain na thi ko.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cucaah cun i hlau law na ngeih rihmi kha a thih taktak hlanah thazang thar la tuah. Zeicahtiah na tuahmi thil kha Pathian mit hmuh ah a tlingmi an si rih lo ti kha ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cucaah cun zeidah an in cawnpiakmi kha a si ti le zeitindah na rak theih ti kha philh hlah, cucu zul law na sualnak kha mertak hna. Naa hlauh lo ahcun mifir bantukin kaan rathnawh lai i ka rat caan kha a hngalh hmanh na hngal lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Asinain Sardis khua i a ummi tlawmpal nih cun nan puan kha thiang tein nan chiah ko. Puan rang aih in keimah sinah nan i chawk lai, zeicahtiah cu bantukin aa chawk dingah cun aa tlakmi nan si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Teitu a simi hna cu hi bantukin puan rang an i aih lai i a nungmi hna cauk chung khan an min cu ka hlo lai lo. Ka Pa le a vancungmi hna hmaiah langhngan in, hi hna cu ka mi an si, ka ti lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />“Hna nan ngeih ahcun, Thlarau nih Khrihfabu hna sinah a chimmi cu ngai tuah u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />“Filadelfia khua i a ummi Khrihfabu vancungmi sinah hi bangin va ṭial tuah: Hi bia hi a thiangmi le a taktak a simi, David tawh a tlaitu, innka a hun tikah ahohmanh nih an khar khawh ti lomi, a khar tikah ahohmanh nih an hun khawh ti lomi bia kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na tuahmi kha ka hngalh; na thazang a tlawm nain kan cawnpiakmi na zulh le ka cungah zumh awk tlak na si kha ka hngalh. Innka pakhat kaan hunpiak i ahohmanh nih an khar kho lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ngai hmanh! Judah mi kan si tiah aa ti i a si ṭung lomi, milihchim pawl, Satan ta a simi kha, na hmaiah ka ratter hna lai i na ke hramah ka kunter hna lai. Annih nih an dihlak in, kan dawt kha, an hngalh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Lungsau in um tuah, tiah kan timi kha na zulh caah, vawleicung mi vialte hneksaknak ding caah vawlei cung dihlak ah a tlung laimi harnak caan kha tong loin kan luatter lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka ra zau lai. Na ngeihmi kha ṭha tein i chiah, teinak laksawng na hmuh ding cu ahohmanh nih in chut hna hlah seh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Teitu a simi cu ka Pathian biaknak inn chungah khan tungpi ah ka ser lai i cu biakinn cu zeitikhmanh ah a chuahtak lai lo. Amah cungah cun ka Pathian min kha ka ṭial lai i ka Pathian khualipi, a min Jerusalem thar a simi zong kha a cungah cun ka ṭial lai. Cu khualipi cu ka Pathian sinin vancung khin a rung ṭum lai. Cun a cungah cun ka min thar zong ka ṭial fawn lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />“Hna nan ngeih ahcun, Thlarau nih Khrihfabu hna sinah a chimmi bia cu ngai tuah u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Laodisia khua i a ummi Khrihfabu vancungmi sinah hi bangin va ṭial tuah: Hi bia hi zumhawktlak le ahmaan taktakmi tehte Amen bia kha a si; amah cu Pathian nih a sermi vialte hram a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Na tuahmi kha ka hngalh ko; a kih zong na kik lo, a lum zong na lum lo. A kih zong kik lawlaw, a lum zong lum lawlaw law ka duh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A lum menmen na si i a lum zong na lum lawlaw lo i a kih zong na kih lawlaw fawn lo caah, ka kaa chungin kan chak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Ka rum ko, kaa za ko, zeihmanh ka bau lo, na ti. Asinain zeitluk sifak le zaangfah awk tlak dah na si kha naa hngal lo. Na si a fak, puan aih awk hmanh na ngei lo i na mit a caw.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cucaah ruahnak kan cheuh duhmi cu, keimah sinin sui thiang taktak kha ka caw law na rum lai. Cun naa thuamhnak ding le taklawng in na umnak ningzahnak khuhnak ding caah, thil rang i cawk fawn. Cun na mit thuh awkah si zong i cawk law cuticun khua na hmu kho lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Ka dawtmi cu ka chimhhrin hna i dan ka tat tawn hna. Cucaah cun i biatak law na sualnak kha mertak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Ngaihmanh! innka ah ka dir i ka kingh. Ahohmanh an si ah, ka aw a thei i innka a ka hunhmi cu, a inn chungah cun ka lut lai i a sinah rawl ka dum lai i amah zong ka sinah a dum ve lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Keimah kha teitu ka si i ka Pa pawngah a bawiṭhutdan cungah ka ṭhut bantuk hin, teitu a simi cu ka bawiṭhutdan cung i ka pawngah ṭhutnak nawl kha ka pek hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />“Hna nan ngeih ahcun, Thlarau nih Khrihfabu hna sinah a chimmi bia cu ngai tuah u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Hi dih hin langhnak a dang pakhat ka hmuh ṭhan i vancung ah khin innka pakhat aa hungmi kha ka hmuh. Cun hlan deuh ah ka rak theihmi aw, muko aw bantuk a simi kha, a hung thang i, “Hika ah hin hung kai law, hi dih hin zeidah a um lai ti kha kan hmuhsak lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Thlarau nih cun khulrang in a ka tlaih. Cun vancung ah cun bawiṭhutdan pakhat a ummi a cungah cun mi pakhat a ṭhut kha ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A hmai cu jasper lungvar le karnelian lungvar bantukin a tleu i bawiṭhutdan velchum ah cun emeral lungvar mui a kengmi chuncha kha, aa zel.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawiṭhutdan cu a velchum in bawiṭhutdan dang kul le pali nih an kulh i cu bawiṭhutdan hna cungah cun, puan rang aa aih i sui luchin aa chinhmi upa kul le pali an ṭhu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Bawiṭhutdan cun nimtlau aa lek i khuari thawng kha a thang. Bawiṭhutdan hmaiah cun meifar vanmi pasarih an um i cu hna cu Pathian thlarau pasarih kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Bawiṭhutdan hmaiah cun thlalang fim bantuk a simi rili a um. Bawiṭhutdan cu a hnulei, a hmailei le a sirlei veve in saram nung pali nih an kulh i cu saram hna cu hmailei he hnulei he mit in an khat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Saram nung pakhatnak cu chiandeih he an i lo, pahnihnak cu cawfa he an i lo, pathumnak cu a hmai minung hmai bantuk a si, palinak cu a zuang liomi mupi bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Saram nung pali hna nih cun thla paruk cio an ngei i an chunglei he an lenglei he mit in an khat. Chunzan in hlasak an ngol lo i: “A thiang, a thiang, a thiang, Lianngan Bik Bawipa Pathian cu, Amah cu a um cangmi le a um liomi le a um laimi a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A nungmi saram pali nih cun bawiṭhutdan cung i a ṭhumi, zungzal in zungzal tiang a nungmi cu, sunparnak le upatnak le lawmhnak hla in an thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cu bantukin an thangṭhat tikah upa kul le pali kha bawiṭhutdan cung i a ummi hmaiah cun an kun i zungzal in zungzal tiang a nungmi cu an biak. An suiluchin kha bawiṭhutdan hmaiah cun an chiah hna i,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />“Kan Bawipa le kan Pathian, Nangmah cu sunparnak le upatnak le lianhngannak kha hmuh awkah aa tlakmi na si. Zeicahtiah zeizong vialte kha nangmah nih na ser hna i Nangmah duhnak bangin annih cu ser an si i nunnak an ngei,” tiah an ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Bawiṭhutdan cung i a ṭhumi nih cun cazual pakhat a orhlei kut in aa put kha ka hmuh i cu cazual cu a chunglei he a lenglei he aa ṭial dih i cakhenh pasarih in an khenh chih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun vancungmi pakhat a ṭhawng ngaimi kha ka hmuh i cu vancungmi nih cun, “Ahodah cakhenhnak phoih awk le cazual samh awkah aa tlak hnga,” tiah fak piin a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw cu cazual a phoih i a chung a zoh khotu cu vancung ah siseh, vawleicung ah siseh, vawlei toiah siseh, ahohmanh an hmu kho hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cu cazual cu phoih i a chung kha a zoh khotu dingah aa tlakmi ahohmanh an hmuh khawh hna lo caah fak piin ka ṭap.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cu tikah upa pakhat nih khan a hun ka chawnh i, “Ṭap hlah! Zohhmanh, Judah phun chungin a chuakmi Chiandeih, David tefa milianngan nih khan, teinak a hmuh cang i cakhenhnak pasarih kha a phoih khawh hna i cazual kha a kau khawh,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun Tuufa pakhat, bawiṭhutdan laifang ah a dir i saram nung pali hna le upa hna nih an kulh kha ka hmuh. Tuufa cu an rak thahmi si dawh a si. Ki pasarih le mit pasarih a ngei i a mit pasarih cu Pathian nih vawlei cung khuazakip ah a thlahmi Pathian thlarau pasarih kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Tuufa cu a va kal i bawiṭhutdan cung i a ṭhumi orhlei kut i cazual kha a va lak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cu ti a va lak ahcun saram nung pali hna le upa kul le pali hna kha Tuufa hmaiah cun an kun. Pakhat nih tingtang pakhat cio le zihmui a khatmi sui kheng pakhat cio an i put, sui kheng chung zihmui cu Pathian mi hna thlacamnak kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Hla thar kha an sa i: “Nangmah cu cazual kha lak awk le a khuhnak kha phoih awkah naa tlak. Zeicahtiah an in thah i na thihnak thawngin, Hrin kip le chung kip le holh kip le phun kip chungin, Minung cu Pathian sinah na phakpi hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Kan Pathian rian tlangbawi bantukin a ṭuantu dingah siangpahrang phun ah na ser hna i Annih nih vawlei cu an uk lai,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ka hun zoh ṭhan i vancungmi a rel in rel cawk lomi aw thawng kha ka theih. Annih cu bawiṭhutdan le saram nung pali hna le upa hna velchum ah khan an dir i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />fak piin hla an sa i, “An thahmi Tuufa kha, Lianhngannak le rumnak le fimnak le ṭhawnnak le upatnak le sunparnak le thangṭhatnak hmuh awkah aa tlak,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun vancung i a ummi le vawlei cung i a ummi le vawlei toi i a ummi le rili chung i a ummi thilnung vialte nih, “Bawiṭhutdan cung i a ṭhumi le Tuufa cu, thangṭhatnak, upatnak, sunparnak le ṭhawnnak kha, An cungah zungzal in zungzal tiang um ko seh,” tiin hla an sak kha ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Saram nung pali hna nih khan, “Amen,” tiin an rak leh hna i upa hna cu an kun i an biak.
  </para>
  <chapter number="6" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun Tuufa nih cakhenh pasarih chung i pakhatnak a phoih kha ka hmuh. Cun saram nung pali hna lak i pakhat nih khan khuari thawng bantuk a simi aw in, “Ra,” a ti kha ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hun zoh i rang rang pakhat ka hmuh. A cung i aa citmi nih cun likuk pakhat aa put i amah cu bawiluchin pakhat an pek. Teitu nih tei awkah aa thawh bantukin aa thawh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun Tuufa nih cun cakhenh pahnihnak kha a phoih i saram nung pahnihnak nih, “Ra,” a ti kha ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Rang dang pakhat a hung chuak i rang sen a si. A cung i aa citmi cu, vawlei cung i ral thawhternak ṭhawnnak kha an pek, cucu zeicahdah a si tiah, mi kha pakhat le pakhat i that hna seh, ti caah a si; amah cu vainam nganpi an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun Tuufa nih cun cakhenh pathumnak kha a phoih; cun saram nung pathumnak nih, “Ra,” a ti kha ka theih. Ka hun zoh i rang nak pakhat ka hmuh. A cung i aa citmi nih cun cuaithlainak pakhat aa put.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Saram nung pali hna lakin a chuakmi aw a lomi aw pakhat ka theih i cu aw nih cun, “Ni khat ni hlawh caah changvut cu khiat khat, barli cu khiat thum. Sihmanhsehlaw oliv chiti le mitsur hang cu hrawk hna hlah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Tuufa nih cun cakhenh palinak kha a phoih i saram nung palinak nih, “Ra,” a ti kha ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Ka hun zoh i rangrau diapduap pakhat ka hmuh. A cung i aa citmi cu a min ah Thihnak a si i Hell nih a hnulei in a zulh. Vawlei cung cheu li cheu khat uknak nawl kha pek an si i ral in siseh, mangṭam in siseh, rai in siseh, sahrang in siseh, mi thah khawhnak nawl kha pek an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun Tuufa nih cun cakhenh panga-nak kha a phoih. Pathian bia an chim ruangah le Pathian tehte an sinak ah zumhawktlak in an um ruangah an thahmi hna thlarau kha biakṭheng toiah cun ka hmuh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Fak piin an au i, “A lianngan bik Pathian, a thiang i a taktak a simi Pathian, vawleicung mi, a kan thattu hna hi zei can dah kan phuhlam loin na um hna lai i an biaceih loin na um hna lai,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Annih cu puan rang pakhat cio an pek hna i, “Tlawm tein i din ko rih u. Nanmah bantukin thihnak a ing ve ding nan salhawi le nan unau hna an tling rih lo,” tiah an ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun Tuufa nih cakhenh paruknak a phoih kha ka hmuh. A fak ngaimi lihnin a um i ni cu puanchia nak bantukin a nak i thlapa cu thisen bantukin a sen dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun thli fak nih a kung a hninh tik i theipi kuh a ṭilmi bantuk khin arfi cu vancung in vawlei ah an rung tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cazual an zual bantuk khin van cu a lo i tlang le tikulh vialte cu an umnak hmun in an ṭhial dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun vawlei cung siangpahrang hna le uktu hna le ralbawi hna le mirum hna le miṭhawng hna le midang vialte cu sal he a luatmi he, tlang cung lungkua le lungpi toiah an i thup dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Tlang le lungpi cu an auh hna i, “Kan nenh u law bawiṭhutdan cungah a ṭhumi hmai le Tuufa thinhunnak cun kan phen tuah u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />An thinlinh ni ni lianngan cu an phan cang i aho nih dah a celh lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="7" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cu hnuah cun vancungmi pali vawlei kil li cung i an dir kha ka hmuh i vawlei cung thlitu pali hna kha, vawlei cungah siseh, rili cungah siseh, thingkung cungah siseh, an hrannak hnga lo an thlauh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun nichuahlei in vancungmi a dang pakhat a nungmi Pathian cakhenhnak he a rat kha ka hmuh. Pathian nih vawlei le rili hrawh khawhnak nawl a pekmi vancungmi pali kha aw fak piin a auh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vancungmi nih cun, “Kan Pathian sal hna kha an cal ah hmelchunhnak kan khenh hna hlan cu vawlei le rili le thingkung kha hrawk hna hlah u,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun an cal ah Pathian cakhenhnak in hmelchunhnak an khenhmi hna cu thong za khat le thong sawm li le thong li an si, Israel phun dihlak chungin an si, tiah an ka chimh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Judah phun in thong hleihnih, Reuben phun in thong hleihnih, Gad phun in thong hleihnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Asher phun in thong hleihnih, Naftali phun in thong hleihnih, Manasseh phun in thong hleihnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Simeon phun in thong hleihnih, Levi phun in thong hleihnih, Issakhar phun in thong hleihnih,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Zebulun phun in thong hleihnih, Josef phun in thong hleihnih, Benjamin phun in thong hleihnih an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cu hnuah cun khua ka hun zoh i mibu nganpi, ahohmanh nih a rel in an rel cawk lomi khi ka hmuh. Annih cu phun kip, ram kip, holh kip le hrin kip chungin a rami an si i bawiṭhutdan hmai le Tuufa hmaiah cun an dir i puan rang an i aih i tum hnah kha an i put.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Fak piin an au i, “Kan khamhnak cu bawiṭhutdan cungah a ṭhumi Pathian le Tuufa sinin a rami a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vancungmi vialte cu bawiṭhutdan le upa hna le saram nung pali hna vel chum ah khan an dir. Cun bawiṭhutdan hmaiah cun an kun i Pathian kha an biak i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Amen! Thangṭhatnak le sunparnak le fimnak le lunglawmhnak le upatnak le ṭhawnnak le thil ti khawhnak cu zungzal in zungzal tiang kan Pathian ta a si! Amen!” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Upa pakhat nih khan a ka hal i, “Puan rang aa aihmi hna hi ahodah an si i khuazei in a rami dah an si?” tiah a ka ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />“Ka hngal lo, bawipa, Nangmah nih ta na hngalh deuh lai,” tiah ka leh. Cun a ka thawh i, “Hi mi hna hi hremnak nganpi a ingmi kha an si; Tuufa thi chungah an puan kha an suk i an puan cu an vaar cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cucaah cun Pathian bawiṭhutdan hmaiah an dir i chunzan in biakinn chungah a rian kha an ṭuan. Bawiṭhutdan cung i a ṭhumi nih khan a umpi hna i a ven hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Annih cu an ti a hal in an rawl a ṭam ti lai lo; ni nih a linh ti hna lai lo i thlanhri puak in zeihmanh nih a umter ti hna lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zeicahtiah bawiṭhutdan laifang i a ummi Tuufa kha an tuukhal a si lai i nunnak tiput cerhkam ah a kalpi hna lai. Cun Pathian nih an mitthli vialte kha a hnawhpiak dih hna lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="8" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tuufa nih cakhenh pasarihnak kha a phoih i vancung cu suimilam a cheu chung dai ṭhup in a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Pathian hmaiah a dirmi vancungmi pasarih kha ka hmuh hna i muko pasarih an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />A dang vancungmi pakhat, zihmui khanghnak umte pakhat aa putmi kha a ra i biakṭheng pawngah cun a ra dir. Pathian mi hna an thlacamnak i toih awkah le bawiṭhutdan hmai i a ummi sui biakṭheng cung i khangh awkah zihmui tampi an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Pathian hmai i a dirmi vancungmi kut cun zihmui khu cu Pathian mi hna thlacamnak he khan an kai ṭi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun vancungmi nih khan zihmui um cu aa lak i biakṭheng cung i a ummi mei kha a chungah cun a rawn i vawlei cungah a hlonh. Khua a ri; ṭek a tla, nimtlau a lek i li aa hnin.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun vancungmi pasarih hna nih khan an muko pasarih cu tum awkah an i tim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vancungmi pakhatnak nih khan a muko cu a vun tum, rial le mei, thisen he aa cawhmi a sur in vawlei cungah an sur. Vawlei cheu thum cheu khat kha a kang dih, thingkung cheu thum cheu khat kha an kang i ram hring vialte kha an kang dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vancungmi pahnihnak nih khan a muko cu a vun tum, tlang nganpi a alh hluahmahmi bantuk khi rili chungah a tla. Rili cheu thum cheu khat kha thisen ah a cang i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />rili chung i a ummi thilnung cheu thum cheu khat kha an thi, cun sangphawlawng cheu thum cheu khat kha an rawk.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Vancungmi pathumnak nih khan a muko cu a vun tum, meifar alh bantuk a simi arfi nganpi pakhat cu van in, tiva cheu thum cheu khat le cerh cheu thum cheu khat cungah, a rung tla.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />(Cu arfi cu a min ah ‘A kha’ ti a si). Ti cu cheu thum cheu khat a kha i, ti cu a khaat caah cu ti a dingmi cu mi tampi an thi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun vancungmi palinak nih a muko cu a vun tum, nika cu cheu thum ah cheu khat a beuh i thlapa zong cheu thum ah cheu khat a beuh ve, arfi zong cheu thum ah cheu khat an lo fawn. Cucaah cun an ceunak cu cheu thum ah cheu khat a zor i chun ah ṭhen thum ṭhen khat chung a mui i zan zongah ṭhen thum ṭhen khat chung ceunak a um lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun khua ka hun zoh i vanlai ah sang piin a zuangmi mupi pakhat nih aw fakpi i, “Ṭih a va nung thiam dah! Ṭih a va nung thiam dah! A dang vanmi pathum hna nih an muko an tum ve tikah vawlei mi vialte hna caah zeitluk riamruam in dik ṭih a nun lai!” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="9" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun vancungmi panganak nih khan a muko cu a vun tum, van in vawlei ah arfi pakhat a tlami ka hmuh; dongh hngal lo khor tawh kha amah cu an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Dongh hngal lo khor cu arfi nih cun a vun hun i somei nganpi chung i meikhu a chuakmi bantuk meikhu kha a hung chuak hluahmah; cu dongh hngal lo khor in a chuakmi meikhu nih cun ni ceunak le thli kha a muihter dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Meikhu chung cun khaubawk an chuak i vawlei cungah an rung ṭum; tlangngaikuang ṭhawnnak bantuk kha khaubawk cu an pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Ram hring siseh, thingkung siseh, ramkung siseh, hrawk hna hlah u, tiah an ti hna; an cal ah Pathian hmelchunhnak a ngei lomi lawnglawng kha nan hrawh khawh hna, ti an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Hi mi hna thah cu khaubawk kha onh an si lo, a hrem lawng thla nga chung nan hrem hna lai, ti an si. Cu an hrem hnanak fahning cu tlangngaikuang mi henh bantuk khi a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cu thla nga chung cu kha mi hna nih khan thih an i duh deuh lai, sihmanhsehlaw an thi kho ṭung lai lo; thih kha an i kawh lai, sihmanhsehlaw thihnak nih a zamtak ṭung hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Khaubawk cu ral tuknak rangtum he an i lo; an lu ah suiluchin bantuk an i chinh i an hmai cu minung hmai bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />An sam cu nu sam bantuk a si i an ha cu chiandeih ha bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />An ṭang ah thir angki bantuk an i aih i an thla khawn thawng cu, raltuknak hmun ah a le cutmatmi rangleng tampi thawng bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlangngaikuang bantukin mei le mi henhnak zum an ngei i an mei cun minung cu thla nga chung fahnak an pek khawh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />An uktu ah siangpahrang pakhat an ngei i dongh hngal lo khor a uktu vancungmi kha a si. A min cu Hebru holh in Abaddon ti a si; Grik holh cun Apollyon ti a si i a sullam cu “Hrawktu” tinak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Thil ṭihnung hmasa bik cu a dih; hi hnuah hin a dang pahnih a ra ding an um rih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun vancungmi paruknak nih khan a muko cu a vun tum, Pathian hmai i a dirmi sui biakṭheng kap khan aw pakhat ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Muko aa putmi vancungmi paruknak kha aw nih cun a thawh i, “Tiva nganpi Zufrates ah hrenmi vancungmi pali kha thlah hna,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vancungmi pali cu a thlah hna, annih cu hi suimilam thengte le hi ni thengte le hi thla thengte le hi kum thengte i minung vialte cheu thum cheu khat a thattu ding i rak timhlamhmi kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />An rangcung ralkap hna cu nuai za hnih an si tiah an ka chimh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun langhnak ka hmuhmi ah cun rangtum hna le an cung i aa citmi cu ka hmuh hna: an ṭangphaw cu mei bantukin a sen, safaiar lungvar bantukin a dum i kat bantukin a eng. Rangtum cu an lu chiandeih lu bantuk an si i an kaa chungin mei le meikhu le kat kha an chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Rangtum hna kaa chungin a chuakmi hremnak pathum, mei le meikhu le kat nih cun, minung cheu thum cheu khat an thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rangtum cu an ṭhawnnak kha an kaa le an mei ah a um. An mei cu lu an ngei i rul bantuk an si, an mei cun mi kha an hrem hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi hremnak pathum nih a thah lomi, a taangmi minung hna nih khan, anmah nih an ser chommi thil kha an mertak hlei hna lo. Khuachia biak kha an ngol lo i sui le ngun le dar le lung le thing in sermi siasal, khua zong a hmu kho lomi, a theih zong a thei kho lomi, a kal zong a kal kho lo mi biak kha an ngol hlei fawn lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun an lainawn le an pumsa camh le an pumsa sualnak le an fir zong kha an i ngaihchih hlei fawn lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="10" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun vancung in a ṭhawngmi vanmi a dang pakhat a rung ṭum kha ka hmuh. Khuadawm in aa thuam i a lu ah chuncha aa khimh; a hmai cu nika bantuk a si i a ke cu mei tung pipi bantuk an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A kut in aa samhmi cazual hmete pakhat aa put. A orhlei ke in rili kha a lamh i a kehlei ke in vawlei kha a lamh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />cun a au ciammam i a aw cu chiandeih run aw bantuk a si. Cu ti a au dih cun, khuari pasarih nih an hun leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bia an chim dih cangka cun ṭial kaa tim i sihmanhsehlaw vancung in aw pakhat nih, “Khuari pasarih nih an chimmi kha biathli ah chia, ṭial rih hlah,” tiah a run ka ti kha ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun rili cung le vawlei cungah a dirmi vancungmi ka hmuhmi nih khan van leiah a orhlei kut a hler i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />zungzal in zungzal tiang a nungmi Pathian, van le a chung i a ummi thil vialte a sertu, vawlei le a chung i a ummi thil vialte a sertu, rili le a chung i a ummi thil vialte a sertu min khan biakamnak a ser. Vancungmi nih cun aa thawh i, “A rau ti lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vancungmi pasarihnak nih a muko a tum tikah Pathian nih, a sal profet hna sinah a rak chim bang khan, a rak timh thlimi kha a tlinter lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun vancung in aw ka theihmi nih khan a run ka chawnh ṭhan i, “Rili cung le vawlei cungah a dirmi vancungmi nih aa putmi cazual aa samhmi kha va la tuah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vancungmi sinah cun ka va kal i cazual hmete cu ka pe, tiah ka va ti. A ka thawh i, “I lak law ei tuah; na pawpi chungah cun a kha lai, sihmanhsehlaw na ka chungah cun khuaihliti bantukin a thlum lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />A kut i cazual hmete cu ka lak i ka ei, ka ka chungah cun khuaihliti bantukin a thlum. Sihmanhsehlaw ka vun dolh tikah ka paw chungah cun a kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun, “Pathian nih miphun dangdang hna le ram dangdang hna le holh phun dangdang hna le siangpahrang tampi hna kong i a chimmi bia kha na chim ṭhan awk a herh lai,” an ka ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="11" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Tahnak fung caah phaikung pakhat an ka pek i, “Hung kal law Pathian biakinn le biakṭheng kha hung tah hna, cun biakinn chung i Pathian a biami kha hung rel hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Asinain biakinn lenglei tual kha cu va ngaan rih hna. Va tah rih hna hlah, zeicahtiah kha tual kha cu Pathian a bia lomi, thla sawm li le thla hnih chung, Khua Thiang a naang ding hna ca i chiahmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Ka tehte pahnih kha ka thlah hna lai, annih cu buri an i aih lai i ni thong khat le za hnih le sawm ruk chung Pathian bia kha an chim lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cu tehte pahnih hna cu oliv kung pahnih hna le mei-inn pahnih hna, vawlei Bawipa hmai i a dirmi kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Harnak pek a zalmi hna paoh kha an kaa chungin a chuakmi mei in an thah hna; hi bantukin harnak pek a timtu hna paoh cu thah an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Van kharnak nawl kha an ngei i cucaah cun Pathian bia an chim chung cu ruah a sur lai lo. Cerhti put zong kha thi i canternak nawl an ngei fawn. Cun vawlei zong kha an duh tik caan paoh ah hremnak a phunphun in hremnak nawl an ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun bia chim awk an ngeihmi an chim dih tikah, dongh hngal lo khor thukpi chungin a hung chuakmi sahrang nih khan a doh hna lai. A tei hna lai i a thah hna lai;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />an ruak cu khuapi chung lamkalai ah khan an ril lai, cu khua cu an Bawipa vailam i an khenh chihnak khua kha a si. Cu khua cu a min ah minhleng in Sodom, ti asiloah, Izipt ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Phun kip, ram kip, le holh kip chungin a rami hna nih khan an ruak cu ni thum le a cheu chung an zoh hna lai i vui kha onh an si lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Hi profet pahnih hna nih hin vawleicung mi kha temhnak tampi an pek hna caah, hi hna pahnih an thihnak ah hin vawlei cung mi cu an i lawm lai i an thihnak cu an tuk an aih lai i pakhat le pakhat laksawng an i ṭhen lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Ni thum le a cheu hnuah Pathian sinin nunnak petu thaw kha a ra i an chungah a lut i annih cu an dir; a hmumi vialte hna cu an thlakawk a bar hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun cu profet pahnih hna nih cun, vancung in, “Hika ah hin hung kai u,” tiah aw thang piin a run titu hna aw kha an theih. An ral nih an zoh ko hna lioah cun, vancung ah khuadawm in an kai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cu caan te ah cun lihnin fak ngaingai pakhat a um; khuapi cu cheu hra cheukhat a rawk i minung thong sarih lihnin nih cun a thah hna. A tangmi pawl cu an thin a phang i vancung Pathian a lianhngannak kha an thangṭhat.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thil ṭihnung pahnihnak cu a dih cang; sihmanhsehlaw zohhmanh, thil ṭihnung pathumnak a ra zau lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun vancungmi pasarihnak nih khan a muko cu a vun tum i aw thawng fakpi vancung ah cun a thang i, “Vawlei cung uknak nawl cu kan Bawipa le a Messiah ta a si cang,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun Pathian hmaiah bawiṭhutdan cung i a ṭhumi upa kul le pali hna kha an kun i Pathian cu an biak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />“A Lianngan Bik Bawipa Pathian, Nang cu atu i a ummi le hlan i a rak ummi na si. A liannganmi na ṭhawnnak kha na hman cang i Uknak hram naa thawk cang caah, Na cungah kan i lawm.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Atu caan hi na thinhunnak a rat caan le Mithi hna biaceih caan a si caah, Pathian bia lomi cu an thin a hung ngaingai. Cun atu caan hi na sal na profet hna le na mi vialte hna le nangmah an ṭihtu vialte hna kha, A hme a ngan thlu loin laksawng pek caan a si fawn. Cun vawlei a hrawktu hna hrawh caan kha a si,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Vancung i a ummi Pathian biakinn cu a hun i a chung i biakamnak an chiahnak kuang kha a lang. Cun nimtlau a lek, ṭek a tla, khua a ri, li aa hnin i fak piin rial a tla.
  </para>
  <chapter number="12" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun van ah khin khuaruahhar a simi hmelchunhnak nganpi pakhat a lang. Minu pakhat a lang i a thuam ah nika a si; thlapa kha a ke in aa lamh i a lu ah arfi hleihnih bawiluchin aa chinh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Nau a hring dengmang i nau nganfah in a ai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun van ah cun khuaruahhar a simi hmelchunhnak a dang pakhat a lang ṭhan. A ngan ngaingaimi limkeng senpi, lu pasarih le ki pahra a ngeimi kha a hung lang i a lu ah cun bawiluchin pakhat cio an um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />A mei in arfi cheu thum cheu khat kha vancung cun a run kuaih ciammam hna i vawlei ah a thlak hna. Nau a hring dengmangmi nu hmaiah cun a dir i cu a dir cu a fa kha a chuah cangka in ka ei lai ti a duh caah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun miphun vialte thirfung in a uktu ding fapa kha minu nih cun a hrin. Sihmanhsehlaw ngakchia cu an lak zau i Pathian le a bawiṭhutdan sinah an kalpi.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Minu cu Pathian nih a rak timhpiak cangmi hmun ah thetse ram ah khan a zam i khika ah ni thong khat le ni za hnih le ni sawm ruk an rak zohkhenh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun van ah khin raldohnak a um. Mikhael le a vancungmi hna nih khan limkeng cu an doh i limkeng nih cun a vancungmi hna he a rak doh ve hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw limkeng cu a sung i amah le a vancungmi hna cu van ah umnak nawl an ngei ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Limkeng nganpi cu lengah an hlonh. Cu limkeng cu rulpi tar, Khuachia, asiloah, Satan timi, vawleicung mi vialte a hleng dihtu hna kha a si. Amah cu a vancungmi vialte hna he vawlei ah an thlak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun vancung ah cun aw thangpi pakhat ka theih i, “Atu cu Pathian khamhnak a phan cang! Atu cu Pathian nih a ṭhawnnak kha siangpahrang bantukin a langhter cang. Atu cu a Messiah nih khan a nawlngeihnak kha a langhter cang. Kannih kan unau hna sual a puhtu, Pathian hmaiah dir riangmang in chunzan in sual a puh zungzaltu hna kha, vancung in lengah hlonh a si cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Kan unau hna nih amah cu Tuufa thi thawngin le an chimmi bia biatak a simi thawngin an tei cang; an nunnak pek kha an rak sian i thih zong an rak ngamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cucaah cun nannih van hna le khika i a ummi vialte hna, i lawm tuah u. Sihmanhsehlaw vawlei le rili caah cun ṭihnung a va si hringhran dah! Zeicahtiah Khuachia cu nan sinah a rung ṭum cang i cu pinah caan tawite lawnglawng ka ngei ti kha a hngalh fawn caah a thin a linh in a lin ko,” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Limkeng nih vawlei cungah thlak ka si cang ti kha a hngalh tikah, fapa a hringtu nu kha a dawi colh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Thetse ram chung i aa thuhnak ding hmun i va zuannak ding caah khan minu cu mupi nganpi thla pahnih an pek i cuka hmun ah cun kum thum le a cheu an rak zohkhenh lai caah rulpi nih khan zeihmanh a ti kho lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cun minu cu fenh seh tiah limkeng nih khan a kaa chungin tilian a chuahter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw vawlei nih minu cu a rak bawmh; a kaa kha a an i limkeng kaa chungin a chuakmi tilian kha a rak dolh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Limkeng cu minu cungah khan a thin a hung ngaingai i minu tefa a tang rihmi vialte hna doh awkah khan aa thawh; cu hna cu Pathian nawlbia a ngai i Jesuh nih a phuanmi biatak, zumh awk tlak tein aa tlaihmi kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun limkengpi cu rilikam ah khan a dir.
  </para>
  <chapter number="13" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun sahrang pakhat rili chungin a hung chuah kha ka hmuh. Ki pahra le lu pasarih a ngei, a ki cungah cun bawiluchin pakhat cio an um i a lu cungah cun Pathian thangchiatnak min pakhat cio an i ṭial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Ka hmuhmi sahrang cu a mui ah pawlai a lo, a ke cu vom ke bantuk a si i a kaa cu chiandeih kaa bantuk a si. Limkeng nih khan sahrang cu, a ṭhawnnak le a bawi ṭhutdan le a nawlngeihnak a kau ngaingaimi kha a pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sahrang lu pakhat cu, voi khat cu rak that cang hna seh law a lo, sihmanhsehlaw cu thihpi awk tlak a hma cu a dam cang. Vawleicung mi vialte cu an khuaruah a har i sahrang cu an zulh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Limkeng nih khan a nawlngeihnak cu sahrang kha a pek caah mi vialte nih limkeng cu an biak. Sahrang zong cu an biak i, “Sahrang bantuk hi ahodah a um hnga? Aho nih dah an doh khawh lai?” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Sahrang cu a ṭhalo tuk hringhranmi thil kha chim onh a si i thla sawm li le thla hnih chung nawlngeihnak ngeih onh a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian le Pathian min le Pathian a umnak hmun vancung khua i a ummi vialte kha a vawlh a pamh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Pathian mi kha doh awk le tei awkah onh a si i phun kip ram kip holh kip le mi kip cungah nawlngeihnak nawl pek a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vawlei cung i a ummi vialte hna nih amah cu an biak lai, sihmanhsehlaw vawlei ser hlan in nunnak cauk chung i an min ṭial a simi hna nih cun an bia lai lo, cu nunnak cauk cu thahmi Tuufa ta kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Cucaah cun theihnak hna nan ngeih ahcun thei ko u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Tlaih awk a simi cu tlaih a si hrimhrim ko lai; vainam in thah awk a simi cu vainam in thah a si hrimhrim ko lai. Hi ah hin Pathian mi hna nih in khawhnak an ngeih le zumhawktlak an si kha an langhter awk a hau,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun sahrang a dang pakhat vawlei chungin a hung chuah kha ka hmuh. Tuufa ki bantuk ki pahnih a ngei i limkeng bantukin bia a chim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Sahrang pakhatnak nih a ngeihmi nawlngeihnak kaupi kha amah hmai hrimhrim ah cun a hman. Thihpi awk tlak a simi hma a ing i a dam ṭhanmi sahrang pakhatnak kha, nan biak hrimhrim lai tiah vawlei le a cung i a ummi vialte cu a hnek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Sahrang pahnihnak nih cun khuaruahhar ngan pipi kha a tuah hna; mi vialte mit hmuh ah vancung in mei kha vawlei ah a tlakter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun vawleicung i khua a sami vialte cu, khuaruahharnak a tuahmi khan a hlen hna; cu khuaruahharnak hna cu sahrang pakhatnak hmaika i tuahnak nawl pek a simi khuaruahharnak kha an si. Vainam in thahhrulhmi a si nain a nungmi sahrang upatnak caah khan milem pakhat nan ser lai, tiah vawlei cung mi vialte kha sahrang nih cun a ti hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sahrang pakhatnak milem chungah khan sahrang pahnihnak cu nunnak thaw khumhnak nawl pek a si i cucaah milem cu a holh kho i amah a bia lomi cu a thah hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Sahrang nih cun mi vialte, a hme si hna seh, a ngan si hna seh, a rum si hna seh, sifak si hna seh, sal si hna seh, a luatmi si hna seh, an dihlak in an orhlei kut asiloah an cal ah hmelchunhnak hramhram in a ngeihter hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cu hmelchunhnak an ngeih lo ahcun ahohmanh nih thil kha a cawk zong an caw kho lo i a zuar zong an zuar kho lo, cu hmelchunhnak cu sahrang min, asiloah, sahrang min ca i hmanmi nambar kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Hika ah hin fimnak hman a hau. A fimmi paoh nih cun sahrang nambar cu an tuak khawh ko lai, zeicahtiah cu nambar cu mi pakhat min ca i hmanmi a si. Cu min nambar cu za ruk sawm ruk paruk a si.
  </para>
  <chapter number="14" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khua ka hun zoh i Zion Tlang i Tuufa a dir ko kha ka hmuh; a sinah cun mi sing khat sang li le thong li an um i cu hna cu an cal i amah min le a Pa min khenhmi kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun tisor nganpi thawng bantuk le khuari thawng bantuk a simi aw pakhat kha vancung in ka theih. Cu ka theihmi aw cu tingtang tum thiammi nih tingtang in aw dawh an tummi bantuk a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Sing khat sang li le thong li hna cu bawiṭhutdan le saram nung pali hna le upa hna lei hoih khan an dir. Vawlei cungin tlanh a simi hna lawng nih an thiam khawhmi hla thar kha an sa.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Annih cu nu he um ṭi loin thiang tein a ummi an si; nu le pa sinak a hngal lomi an si. Tuufa kha a kalnak kip ah an zulh. A tang rihmi minung hna lakin tlanhmi an si i Pathian sin le Tuufa sinah pekchanh hmasa bikmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Lih an chim bal lo, palhnak zeihmanh an tuah lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Vawlei cung mi vialte, phun kip, ram kip, holh kip le mi kip sin i thanh awk a simi, zungzal Thawngṭha aa phorh i vanlai i a zuangmi vancungmi pakhat kha ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Aw thang piin, “Pathian kha ṭih u law a lianhngannak kha thangṭhat u. Zeicahtiah amah nih minung vialte bia a ceih hna lai caan kha a phan cang. Van le vawlei le rili le tiput a sertu kha bia u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Vancungmi pahnihnak nih pakhatnak kha a hun zulh i, “Minu cu a ril cang! Babilon khuapi cu a ril cang. A zu cu mi vialte kha a pek hna i a dinter hna — cu a zu cu a hornak zu ṭhawng kha a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vancungmi pathumnak nih hmasa pahnih hna kha a hun zulh hna i aw fak piin, “Sahrang le a milem a bia i a hmelchunhnak kha a cal ah siseh a kut ah siseh a ngeimi paoh nih cun,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Pathian zu, a thinhunnak zu, a thinhunnak hrai chung i ti cawh hrimhrim loin thletmi kha an din lai. Cu a dingmi vialte cu vancungmi mithiang hna le Tuufa hmaiah, mei chung le kat chungah, hrem an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />A hremtu hna mei a khu cu zungzal in a kai zungzal ko. Sahrang le a milem a biami le sahrang hmelchunhnak a ngeimi hna caah cun, chun zongah zan zongah lungdaih hnangamnak zeihmanh a um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Pathian mi hna, Pathian nawl a ngai i Jesuh cungah zumh awk tlak in khua a sami hna nih cun, hi zawn ah hin in khawhnak an ngeih awk a hau.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun vancung in aw pakhat ka theih i, “Hihi ṭial tuah: Khrih zumh bu tein a thimi cu lunglawmmi an si,” a ti. Cun Thlarau nih, “A si hrimhrim lai. An rianṭuanmi nih khan a zulh hna lai i rian an ṭuannak cun an i din cang lai,” tiah a leh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun khua ka hun zoh i khuadawm rang pakhat ka hmuh, cu cungah cun minung he aa lomi kha a ṭhu, a lu ah sui bawiluchin aa chinh i a kut in a harmi faah pakhat aa put.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Biakinn khan a dang vancungmi pakhat a chuak i khuadawm cung i a ṭhumi cu fak piin a auh i, “A caan a cut cang caah na faah kha hmang law facang kha at tuah; vawlei cung rawl cu ṭuan a cu cang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun khuadawm cung i a ṭhumi nih khan vawlei ah a faah cu a vun hei i rawl cu a ṭuan.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun vancung biakinn chung khan vancungmi a dang pakhat a chuah kha ka hmuh ṭhan i amah zong nih cun a har ngaingaimi faah aa put ve.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Cun vancungmi dang pakhat, mei uktu a simi kha biakṭheng khan a ra. A har ngaimi faah aa putmi vancungmi kha fak piin a hei auh i, “Na faah kha hmang law mitsur kha an hmin cang caah mitsur lo i a ummi mitsur kha ṭuan hna,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cucaah vancungmi nih khan a faah cu vawlei ah a vun hei i mitsur ruang mitsur thei kha a ṭuan hna i Pathian thinhunnak mitsur nennak chungah khan a thlak hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Mitsur thei cu khuapi leng i a ummi mitsur nennak ah khan an nen hna i mitsur nennak chung cun thisen a chuak i khan za hnih a luang i pe nga tluk a thuk.
  </para>
  <chapter number="15" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun van ah khin khuaruahhar le lianngan ngai a simi hmelchunhnak a dang pakhat ka hmuh ṭhan. Vancungmi pasarih, hremnak pasarih aa putmi kha ka hmuh hna i cu hremnak cu a hmanung bik an si cang, zeicahtiah Pathian thinhun phuannak a donghnak an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Khua ka hei zoh i mei he cawhmi thlalang rili he, aa lomi kha ka hmuh. Cun a min, nambar in chimmi sahrang le a milem a teitu hna kha ka hmuh hna. Annih cu thlalang rilikam ah khan an dir i Pathian nih a pekmi hna tingtang kha an i put.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Annih cu Pathian sal Moses hla kha le Tuufa hla kha an sa i, “Bawipa, a lianngan bik Pathian, Zeitluk in dah na thil tuahmi hi an lianhngan i khuaruahhar an si. Miphun vialte Siangpahrang, Na lam cu zeitluk in dah a dikmi le a hmaanmi a si!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Bawipa, ahodah nangmah ṭih loin a um ngam lai? Na lianngannak chim duh loin ahodah a um lai? Nangmah lawng a thiangmi na si. Miphun vialte nih na hmaiah an ra lai i an in biak lai, Thil ding na tuahmi kha mi vialte nih hmuh a si caah,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cu hnuah cun vancung i biakinn aa hun kha ka hmuh i a chungah cun Biakamnak Thlam kha a um.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hremnak pasarih aa putmi vancungmi biakinn chungin an chuah kha ka hmuh; puan rang thiang an i aih i an ṭang ah sui ṭangmenh kha an i menh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun saram nung pali hna lak i pakhat nih khan vancungmi pasarih hna cu, zungzal in zungzal tiang a nungmi Pathian thinhunnak in a khatmi sui kanto pasarih kha a pek hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Biakinn cu Pathian sunparnak le lianhngannak meikhu in a khat i vancungmi pasarih nih hremnak pasarih an tlunpimi a dih hlantiang ahohmanh biakinn chungah cun an lut kho lo.
  </para>
  <chapter number="16" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun biakinn khan aw thangpi pakhat nih vancungmi pasarih hna cu, “Va kal u law Pathian thinhunnak kanto pasarih kha vawlei ah va thle hna u,” tiah a ti thawng kha ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vancungmi pakhat cu a kal i a kanto cu vawlei ah khan a bungh. Sahrang hmelchunhnak a ngeimi hna le a milem a biami hna kha ṭih a nung ngaingaimi le a fak ngaingaimi hmachia nih a tlunh hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun vancungmi pahnihnak nih a kanto cu rili ah a bungh. Ti cu mithi mi chungin a chuakmi thisen bantuk ah a cang i rili chung thilnung vialte cu an thi dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun vancungmi pathumnak nih a kanto cu tiva le tiput cungah khan a bungh i thisen ah an cang dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Ti a uktu vancungmi nih cun, “Hi na tuahmi biaceihnak ah hin na ding ko, maw a Thiang Mi, atu i a um liomi le hlan i a rak um cangmi Pathian!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Pathian mi hna le profet hna kha an thi an rak chuah hna caah nangmah nih annih cu din awkah thi kha na pek ve hna. Annih nih hmuh awk i an i tlakmi kha an hmuh ko,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun biakṭheng khan aw pakhat a rak chuak i “Bawipa, Lian Ngan Bik Pathian, na biakhiahnak cu a dingmi le a hmaanmi an si taktak,” tiah a ti thawng kha ka theih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Cun vancungmi palinak nih a kanto kha ni cungah a bungh i ni cu mi kha khanghnak nawl a hmu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Ni lin nih cun mi kha a kangh hna i hi hremnak cung i nawl a ngeitu Pathian min kha an thang chiat. Asinain an sualnak kha an mertak duh lo i Pathian lianhngannak kha an thangṭhat duh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun vancungmi panganak nih a kanto cu sahrang bawiṭhutdan cungah khan a bungh. Sahrang pennak ram cungah khan muihnak a tlung ciammam i fahnak an inmi kha a fah tuk caah an lei kha an i seh,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />cun fahnak le hmachia an in ruangah khan vancung Pathian cu an thangchiat. Asinain an lam ṭhalo kha an kaltak hlei lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun vancungmi paruknak nih a kanto cu Zufrates tivapi cungah a bungh. Tiva cu a kao i nichuahlei in a rami siangpahrang hna caah khan lam a rak awnter.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun thlarau thur pathum, utlak a lomi kha ka hmuh hna; limkeng kaa chung le sahrang kaa chung le nal profet kaa chungin an hung chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Annih cu khuachia thlarau, khuaruahharnak a tuah khomi kha an si. Cu thlarau pathum hna cu vawleicung khuazakip ah khan an kal i vawleicung siangpahrang vialte kha an pumh hna. Cu bantukin hmunkhat ah an pumh hna cu, Lianngan Bik Pathian ni lianngan ni ah pakhat le pakhat i do hna seh ti caah a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />“Ngai hmanh, mifir bantukin ka ra lai. Zapi lakah taklawng in an vah nakhnga lo le ningzak in an um nakhnga lo, hngilh lo tein a rak um i a hnipuan ṭha tein a rak i fimhlawmmi cu, lunglawmmi an si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Cun thlarau hna nih khan siangpahrang cu hmunkhat ah an pumh hna i cu hmun cu Hebru holh in Armageddon ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun vancungmi pasarihnak nih khan a kanto cu thlitu lakah a bungh. Biakinn chung bawiṭhutdan khan aw thangpi pakhat a ra chuak i, “A dih cang!” tiah a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Nimtlau a lek, khua a ri, ṭek a tla i ṭihnung ngaingai in li aa hnin. Minung ser hramthawk in cu bantuk lihnin cu a um bal lo; lihnin vialte lakah lihnin fak bik a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khualipi cu cheu thum ah a kuai i ram vialte cu an khua kha an rawk dih. Pathian nih a liannganmi Babilon kha a philh lo i a hrai chung zu kha a dinter — a thinhunnak zu kha.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Tikulh vialte kha an lo dih i tlang vialte zong kha an lo dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rial ngan pipi, pawng za khat tiang a ritmi kha van in minung cungah an tla. Cun mi nih rial in hremnak an in ruangah cun Pathian kha an thangchiat, an inmi hremnak cu a fak hringhranmi a si ko.
  </para>
  <chapter number="17" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun vancungmi pasarih lak i pakhat, kanto aa putmi kha ka sinah a ra i, “Ra law, rilipi cungah bawinu ṭhut in a ṭhumi hlawhhlangnu milianngan nu kha, zeitindah dantat a si lai, ti kha kan hmuhsak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Vawlei cung siangpahrang hna nih hlawhhlangnu milianngan nu he cun sualnak an tuah i a sualnak zu an dinnak cun vawlei cung mi cu an ri dih,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Thlarau nih khan a ka tlaih i vancungmi nih khan thetse ram ah a ka kalpi. Cuka ah cun nu pakhat, sahrang sen cung i aa citmi kha ka hmuh i cu sahrang cu a tak khat in min ṭhalo aa ṭial; cu sahrang nih cun lu pasarih le ki pahra a ngei.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Nu cu maimaw le puansen in aa thuam i sui hlawn le lungvar le pale lungvar in aa ṭamh. A kut in sui hrai pakhat aa put i cu sui hrai cu fihnung le ṭeifiak in a khat, cu fihnung le ṭeifiak cu a sualnak theitlai kha an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />A cal ah min pakhat aa ṭial i cu min cu sullam hleng a ngei. Cu min cu, “A liannganmi Babilon, vawlei cung hlawhhlangnu vialte le sual thurnak vialte nu,” ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun cu nu cu, Pathian mi hna thisen le Jesuh cungah zumhawktlak in an um ruangah thahmi hna thisen a rit kha ka hmuh. Amah ka hmuh tikah ka khuaruah a har tuk hringhran.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Vancungmi nih cun, “Zeicahdah na khuaruah a har? Minu sullam le aa citmi sahrang, lu pasarih le ki pahra a ngeimi sullam cu kan chimh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Na hmuhmi sahrang kha hlanah cun a rak nung, asinain atu cu a nung ti lo, rawhralnak a phak hlanah dongh hngal lo khor chung khan a hung chuak lai. Vawlei cung i khua a sami, vawlei ser hlan in nunnak cauk chungah an min a rak i ṭial lomi hna nih khan, sahrang cu an hmuh tikah an khuaruah a har lai, zeicahtiah voi khat cu a rak nung, atu cu a nung ti lo, asinain a hung chuak ṭhan lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />“Fim le hngalhthiam a hau. Lu pasarih hi tlang pasarih, nu a ṭhutnak tlang pasarih kha an si. Cun siangpahrang pasarih zong kha an si fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Panga cu an ril cang, pakhat cu atu hi siangpahrang a si lio a si i a dang pakhat cu a ra rih lo; a rat tikah caan tlawmte lawng a um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun hlan i a rak nung i atu i a nung ti lomi sahrang kha, siangpahrang pariatnak a hmasa pasarih bu chung i aa tel vemi kha a si i rawhralnak phak awkah a hung chuak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />“Ki pahra na hmuhmi kha siangpahrang pahra, uknak hram aa thawk rih lomi, sihmanhsehlaw sahrang he suimilam pakhat chung uk ṭi dingin nawl pekmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Hi pahra hna nih hin an dihlak in tinhmi pakhat an ngei i an ṭhawnnak le an nawl ngeihnak cu sahrang kha an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Annih nih Tuufa kha an doh lai; sihmanhsehlaw Tuufa le Tuufa nih a kawh hna i a thim hna i zumhawktlak zultu a simi hna nih khan an tei hna lai, zeicahtiah Tuufa cu bawi vialte Bawipa le siangpahrang vialte Siangpahrang a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Vancungmi nih cun a ka thawh ṭhan i, “Hlawhhlangnu a ṭhutnak rilipi na hmuhmi kha miphun hna le ram hna le holh hna le mi hna an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Ki pahra na hmuhmi le sahrang nih khan hlawhhlangnu kha an huat lai i a ngeihmi vialte kha an chuh dih lai i taklawng in an chiah lai; a sa kha an ei lai i amah cu mei in an khangh lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Zeicahtiah Pathian nih a chimmi bia kha a tlin hlantiang cu, Pathian nih aa tinhmi tuah duhnak kha an lungthin chungah a chiah i cucaah lungnge tein rian an ṭuan i uknak nawl an ngeihmi kha sahrang cu an pek.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />“Nu na hmuhmi cu vawlei cung siangpahrang hna a uktu khualipi kha a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <chapter number="18" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khi hnuah vancung in vanmi dang pakhat a run kha ka hmuh. Nawlngeihnak a ngan ngaingaimi a ngei i a sunparnak nih vawlei cu a ceuh dih.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Fak piin a au i, “Nu kha a ril cang! Babilon Khualipi kha a tlu cang. Khuachia le thlarau thur nih an umhnawh cang i a thurhnawmmi le fihnung a simi vate a phunphun in a khat cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Zeicahtiah a zu kha mi vialte a pek hna i a dinter hna — a hornak zu ṭhawng kha a dinter hna. Vawlei cung siangpahrang hna nih amah he cun nu le pa sualnak an tuah i aa sum lomi a hornak nih cun vawlei cung khuazakip chawlet pawl kha a rumter hna,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun vancung in aw pakhat ka theih ṭhan i, “Ka mi hna, chuak tuah u, Amah chung khan chuak tuah u! Sualnak a tuahmi ah khan i tel hlah u, Dantatnak a hmuh ding zong kha i hrawm hlah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zeicahtiah a sualnak cu van tawng in aa pong i Ṭhat lonak a tuahmi kha Pathian nih a philh lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Amah nih a rak in tuah hna bantukte khan amah cu tuah ṭhan ve u; a let hnih in cham u, Nanmah din awkah a rak tuahmi a let hnih ṭhawng khan, Amah din awk cu a hrai chungah khan serpiak u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Sunparnak le nuamhnak amah le amah a rak i pek zat te khan, Temhinnak le ngaihchiatnak pe ve u. Zeicahtiah aa thawh i, Keimah cu bawiṭhutdan cung i a ṭhumi siangpahrang bawinu ka si. Nuhmei ka si lo, ngaihchiatnak cu ka ing bal lai lo, a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Hi ruangah hin hremnak nih khan ni khatte ah an tlakphuat lai, rai le ngaihchiatnak le mangṭam nih khan a tlakphuat lai. Amah bia a ceihtu Bawipa Pathian cu a ṭhawngmi a si caah Amah cu mei in khangh a si lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />A sualnak le a hornak chungah aa bual vemi vawlei cung siangpahrang hna nih khan a kanghnak meikhu cu an hmuh tikah khuapi cu an ṭah lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Temhnak a inmi kha an ṭih caah a langhlat piin an dir i cuka cun an i thawh i, “Ṭih a hei nung hringhran dah! Mi tuksa a hei pur hringhran dah! Babilon khualipi, khua lianngan le khua ṭhawng! Suimilam pakhat chungah na rawk dih ko!” an ti lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Vawlei cung chawlet pawl zong amah a rawh ruangah cun an ṭap i an ngaih a chia, zeicahtiah an thilri kha ahohmanh nih an caw ti hna lo;
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />an sui, an ngun, an lungvar, an rili lungvar, le la hmangṭhia in tahmi thilri puan sen, pu, maimaw; cun thingrua theihtlei in sermi thil phun zakip, vui ho le thing man sung in sermi thil phun kip,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />nakzik le musala le zihmui le mura zihmui le frankinsen zihmui le zu le chiti le changvut le facang le caw le tuu le rang le rangleng le sal le minung hmanh kha ahohmanh nih an caw ti hna lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Chawlet pawl nih cun an thawh i, “Ngei ning ti i saduh na rak thahmi vialte kha an lo dih cang i na rumnak le na sunparnak vialte cu an liam cang; zeitikhmanh ah na hmu ṭhan ti hna lai lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Cu khuapi chung i chaw a rak dawr tawnmi mirum hna nih khan, a temhinnak cu an ṭih caah a langhlat piin a cuanh in an cuanh lai. An ṭap an ai lai i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Khua lianngan kha zeitluk in dah ṭih a nun cang. Zeitluk in dah mi tuksapur a si cang. Puan hmangṭhia le puan sen le maimaw in a rak i thuam tawn i sui hlawn le lung mansung le rili lungvar in a rak i ṭamh tawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw suimilam pakhat chungah a chawva vialte cu an lo dih ai!” an ti lai. Rili lawngcawng bawi vialte hna le khual tlawngmi vialte hna le tilawng rianṭuantu vialte hna le rili cung rianṭuannak in a paw a cawmmi vialte hna cu lamhlatpi in an dir i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />a kanghnak meikhu kha an hmuh tikah, “Hi khualipi bantukin a liannganmi khua a um bal lo,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />An lu ah lei dip an i phulh, an ṭap an ai i, “Khua lianngan kha zeitluk in dah ṭih a nun cang. Zeitluk in dah tuksapur a si cang. Rili cungah lawng in chaw a letmi vialte hna nih amah rumnak thawngin mirum an rak si dih. Asinain suimilam pakhat chungah a chaw vialte cu an lo dih ko ee,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw amah a rawh ruangah van cu i lawm ko seh. Pathian mi hna le lamkaltu hna le profet hna, i lawm ko u! Zeicahtiah nan cung i a tuahmi ruangah khan Pathian nih amah cu dan a tat cang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Cun a ṭhawngmi vancungmi pakhat nih facang rialnak lung nganpi tia a simi lung pakhat kha aa cawi i rili chungah a hlonh, “Hi bantuk hin Babilon khualipi hi i let luahmah in hlonh a si lai i zeitikhmanh ah hmuh ṭhan a si ti lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />A chung i a rak um tawnmi tingtang tum thiam hna le aw dawh tum thiam hna le thonglawi tum thiam hna le muko tum thiam hna nih an tum tawnmi aw kha zeitikhmanh ah theih ṭhan a um ti lai lo. A chungah rianṭuantu an um ti lai lo i facang rialnak thawng kha theih a um ti lai lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />A chungah meiinn ceu a um ti lai lo; nupi ṭhi tlangval le va ngeimi ngaknu conglawmhnak thawng zong a um ti lai lo. A chung i a rak ummi chawlet pawl cu vawlei cung ah a ṭhawng bik an rak si i hlennak mitleh thiamnak in vawlei cung mi vialte kha an hlen dih hna,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Profet hna le Pathian mi hna kha a chungah an thisen an chuah hna caah Babilon cu dantat a si cang; asi, vawlei cungah thah a simi vialte hna an thisen cu amah chungah cun hmuh an si dih!
  </para>
  <chapter number="19" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cu hnuah cun vancung i a ummi mibu nganpi aw thawng bantuk ka theih i, “Pathian cu thangṭhat ko u. Khamhnak le sunparnak le lianhngannak cu kan Pathian ta an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />A biaceihmi cu dingte le hmaan tein a ceih. Vawlei a hornak in a thurhnawmhtertu hlawhhlangnu milianngan nu kha sual a phawt cang. Pathian sal kha a thah hna caah Pathian nih dan a tat cang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Cun an au ṭhan i, “Pathian cu thangṭhat ko u. Khualipi khanghnak mei a khu cu zungzal in zungzal tiang a kai ko,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Upa kul le pali hna le saram nung pali hna nih khan an kun i bawiṭhutdan cungah a ṭhumi Pathian kha an biak i, “A men! Pathian cu thangṭhat ko u,” an ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun bawiṭhutdan khan aw pakhat a rung thang i, “Kan Pathian sal vialte hna le a mi vialte hna le amah a ṭihmi vialte hna, a hme a ngan in, kan Pathian cu thangṭhat tuah u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun mibu nganpi aw bantuk, tisor nganpi thawng bantuk, khuari thawng bantuk a simi aw pakhat kha ka theih. “Bawipa, Lianngan Bik, kan Pathian cu Siangpahrang a si caah, thangṭhat ko u!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />I lawm u si law i nuam u sih; a lianngannak cu thangṭhat u sih! Zeicahtiah Tuufa nupi ṭhit caan cu a phan cang i a ṭhit laimi ngaknu cu aa tim cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Aa thuamhnak dingah, puan hmang ṭhia a thiang i a cer in a cermi kha pek a si cang,” an ti. (Puan hmangṭhia cu Pathian mi hna nih ding tein rian an ṭuanmi kha a si).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Cun vancungmi nih cun a ka thawh i, “Mah hihi ṭial tuah: Tuufa nupi ṭhitnak puai i sawmmi hna cu milunglawm an va si dah!” a ti. Cun vancungmi nih cun, “Hi bia hi Pathian bia ngaingai an si,” a ti fawn.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Amah biak awkah a ke hramah ka bawk, sihmanhsehlaw a ka thawh i, “Bawk hlah. Keimah zong nangmah bantukin Pathian sal ka si ve, Jesuh nih a phuanmi biatak aa tlaihmi nan unau hna lak i pakhat ka si ve. Pathian tu bia tuah,” a ti. Profet hna kha lungthawhnak a petu cu Jesuh nih a phuanmi biatak kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun van kha aa hung i rang rang pakhat ka hmuh. A cung i aa citmi cu a min ah Zumhawktlak le Ahmaanmi ti a si; bia a ceih tik le ral a doh tikah dinnak in a ceih i a doh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />A mit cu meizik bantuk an si i a lu ah bawiluchin tampi aa chinh. A cungah min pakhat aa ṭial, asinain amah dah ti lo nih cun zei a si ti kha ahohmanh nih an hngal lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Aa aihmi puan cu thi aa neh dih. An auhnak a min cu “Pathian Bia” ti a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Vancung ralkap bu nih khan rang rang cungin an zulh i puan rang in an i thuam.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A har ngaingaimi nam pakhat a kaa chungin a hung chuak i cu nam cun miphun vialte kha a tei dih hna lai. Annih cu thirfung in a uk hna lai i Lianngan Bik Pathian thinhunnak mitsur nennak chung mitsur kha a nen hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />A puan le a ke ah, “siangpahrang vialte Siangpahrang le bawi vialte Bawi,” tiin aa ṭial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Cun nika chungah vanmi pakhat a dir kha ka hmuh. Van i a zuangmi va vialte kha aw fak piin a auh hna i, “Ra tuah u, Pathian nih rawl danghnak nganpi a ser laimi ah cun i pum tuah u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Siangpahrang hna le ralbawi hna le ralkap hna le rang hna le rangcung ralkap hna le sal hna le miluat hna le mingan hna le mihme hna, an dihlak in, an sa cu rak ei tuah hna u,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Rang cung i aa citmi le a ralkapbu kha doh awkah sahrang le vawlei cung siangpahrang hna cu an i pum.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Sahrang cu an tlaih i thong ah an thlak, cun a hmaika i khuaruahharnak a tuah tawntu nal profet zong kha an tlaih chih. (Sahrang hmelchunhnak a ngeimi hna le sahrang milem a biami hna kha, khuaruahharnak a tuahmi khan a hlen hna). Cun sahrang le nal profet cu an pahnih in kat meialh tili ah a nung in an paih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Rang aa citmi kaa chungin a chuakmi vainam nih an ralkap vialte cu a thah dih hna i an sa cu va vialte nih an i serh.
  </para>
  <chapter number="20" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Cun vanmi pakhat vancung in a rung ṭum i dongh hngal lo khor tawh le cikcin nganpi aa put kha ka hmuh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Rulhreu, limkeng kha a tlaih i kum thong khat a hren — cu limkeng cu Khuachia, asiloah, Satan kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Vanmi nih cun dongh hngal lo khor chungah khan a thlak i kum thong khat kha a dih hlantiang, mi kha a hlen khawh ti hna nakhnga lo, a hrenh i ca a khenh chih. Cu hnuah cun tlawmpal chuah a si te lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Cun bawiṭhutdan hna le a cung i a ṭhumi hna kha ka hmuh hna; annih cu biaceihnak nawl kha pek an si. Jesuh nih a phuanmi biatak le Pathian bia an chim ruangah thahnak a ingmi thlarau hna zong kha ka hmuh hna. Sahrang kha an bia lo, a milem zong an bia lo, an cal le an ban zongah sahrang hmelchunhnak kha an ngei lo. An hung nung i Khrih he cun siangpahrang bantukin kum thong khat chung uktu bawi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />(Mithi mi a dang cu kum thong khat a dih hlan kha cu an nung lo). Mah hihi mithi thawhter an si a hmasa u cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Hi mithi thawhter an si a pakhatnak i aa telmi hi cu lunglawmmi le thluachuak hringhranmi an si ko. Thih voi hnihnak nih an cungah nawl zeihmanh a ngei lo; annih cu Pathian le Khrih tlangbawi an si lai i Khrih he cun kum thong khat chung uktu bawi an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Kum thong khat kha a dih tikah Satan cu thong chung khan chuah a si lai i
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />vawlei kil li ah aa ṭhekmi miphun vialte kha hlen awkah aa thawh lai, cu hna cu Gog le Magog kha an si. Satan nih cun i tuk awkah a pumh ciammam hna lai i rili kam thetse zat an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vawleicung khuazakip ah khan an i ṭhek i Pathian mi hna umnak hmun le Pathian nih a dawtmi khua kha an kulh. Sihmanhsehlaw van in mei a rung tla i a thah dih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun annih a hlengtu hna, Khuachia kha, mei le kat tili chungah khan an paih, cuka cu sahrang le nal profet an rak thlaknak hna kha a si; cuka ah cun chunzan in zungzal hrem an si zungzal ko lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cun bawiṭhutdan raangpi le a cung i a ṭhumi kha ka hmuh hna. A cung i a ṭhumi hmaika cun vawlei le van kha an zaam i an um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Cun mithi mi kha, a ngan he a hme he, bawiṭhutdan hmai i an ṭhut kha ka hmuh. Cauk kha an kau hna, cun cauk a dang pakhat, nunnak cauk zong kha an kau ve. Mithi cu an rak tuahmi cauk chung i aa ṭialning khan an bia an ceih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Cun rili nih a chung i a thimi kha a hun chuah hna. Thihnak le mithi khua zong nih khan, an hrenmi mithi kha an hun chuah ve hna. An dihlak in an tuahning cio khan an bia an ceih hna.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Cun thihnak le mithi khua cu mei tili chungah khan an paih hna. (Hi mei tili hi thih voi hnihnak cu a si).
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Nunnak cauk chungah an min aa ṭial lomi paoh cu mei tili chungah cun an paih hna.
  </para>
  <chapter number="21" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Khi hnuah van thar le vawlei thar kha ka hmuh hna. Van hmasa le vawlei hmasa kha an lo cang i rili kha a um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cun Khua Thiang, Jerusalem thar kha Pathian sinin vancung in a rung ṭum cu ka hmuh, va ngei lai ngaknu nih a va ding ton awkah aa ṭamh bantuk khin aa ṭamh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Bawiṭhutdan in aw thangpi pakhat ka theih i, “Pathian umnak inn cu minung hna sinah a um cang. Anmah sinah cun a um lai i annih cu a mi an si lai. Pathian hrimhrim cu an sinah a um lai i amah cu an Pathian a si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />An mitthli vialte kha a hnawh dih hna lai. Thihnak a um ti lai lo, ngaihchiatnak le ṭahnak le fahnak zong a um ti lai lo. Thil hlun vialte cu an lo dih cang,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Cun bawiṭhutdan i a ṭhumi nih cun, “Atu cu thil vialte kha a thar in ka ser dih cang hna,” a ti. A ka thawh i, “Hi bia hi ṭial hna, zeicahtiah ahmaanmi le zumhawktlak a simi bia an si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun aa thawh i, “Rian ka lim dih cang. Kei cu Alfa le Omega, hramthawknak le donghnak ka si. Tihal paoh nunnak tiput ti kha man loin ka dinter hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Teitu a simi paoh nih hihi ka sinin an hmuh lai: Keimah cu an Pathian ka si lai i annih cu ka fa an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw miralchia le mirawi hmang le fih awk lungthin a ngeimi le lainawngmi le horduhcuaimi le camh hmangmi le siasal biami le lihchimmi vialte hna an umnak ding cu, mei le kat in a alhmi tili, thih voi hnihnak kha a si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Vancungmi pasarih hna lak i pakhat, hremnak hmanung bik pasarih in a khatmi kanto pasarih aa putmi kha ka sinah a ra i, “Ra hmanh, Tuufa nupi, va ngei lai ngaknu cu kan hmuhsak lai,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Thlarau nih cun a ka tlaih i vancungmi nih khan tlang sangpi pakhat par ah a ka kaipi. Cun Jerusalem, Khua Thiang kha Pathian sinin vancung in a rung ṭum kha a ka hmuhsak.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Cu khua cu Pathian sunparnak in a cer. Khualipi cu lung man sung, jasper lungvar bantukin a tleu i thlalang bantukin a fiim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Kulhnak vampang nganpi a sang ngaimi pakhat a ngei i cu kulhnak vampang ah cun kutka hleihnih an um i cu kutka hleihnih cu vancungmi hleihnih nih an cawngh hna. Cu kutka ah cun Israel mi phun hleihnih min kha an i ṭial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kam khat ah kutka pathum cio an um: nichuahlei ah pathum, thlanglei ah pathum, chaklei ah pathum, nitlaklei ah pathum an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />Khua kulhnak vampang cu lung pahleihnih cungah bunh a si i cu lung pahleihnih cungah cun Tuufa lamkaltu pahleihnih hna min kha an i ṭial.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />A ka chawntu vanmi nih cun khuapi le a kutka hna le a vampang tahnak ah sui in sermi tahnak fung pakhat aa put.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />Khuapi cu tungvangpalh a si, a tung le a vang aa can ceote a si. Vanmi nih khan khuapi cu tahnak fung khan a tah i a tung khan thong khat le za nga a si, a vang zong a tung can cu a si i a san zong a tung can ṭhiamṭhiam cu a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Vanmi nih khan vampang zong cu a tah i amah nih a hmanmi tahnak ningin dong za sawm li pali a sang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Vampang cu jasper lungvar in ser a si i khuapi cu sui thiang in ser a si i thlalang fim in a fim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Khua kulhnak vampang hram cu lung man sung a phunphun in an ṭamh. A tang nung bik lung cu jasper lungvar a si, a pahnihnak cu safaiar lungvar a si, a pathumnak cu agate lungvar a si, a palinak cu emeral lungvar a si,
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />a panganak cu oniks lungvar a si, a paruknak cu karnelian lungvar a si, a pasarihnak cu khrisolaih lungvar a si, a pariatnak cu beril lungvar a si, a pakuanak cu topaz lungvar a si, a pahranak cu khalsedon lungvar a si, a hlei khatnak cu tarkhua lungvar a si, a hleihnihnak cu amethist lungvar a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Kutka hleihnih cu rili lungvar hlum pipi hleihnih an si, kutka pakhat ah lungvar hlum pakhat a si ko. Khuapi chung lam cu sui thiang a si i thlalang bantukin a tleu.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" />Khuapi chungah cun biakinn ka hmu lo, zeicahtiah a biakinn cu Lianngan Bik Bawipa Pathian le Tuufa kha a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" />Khuapi nih cun ni ceunak siseh, thlapa ceunak siseh a herh lo, zeicahtiah Pathian sunparnak nih cun a ceuh i Tuufa cu a meiinn a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" />Vawleicung miphun zakip nih a ceunak thawng cun kalnak an hmuh lai i vawlei cung siangpahrang hna nih cu khuapi chungah cun an chawhlawn kha an ratpi hna lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" />Khuapi kutka cu chunnitlak in an i hung zungzal ko, zeitikhmanh ah an i khar lo, zeicahtiah khika ah zan a um ti lo.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" />Miphun vialte nih an lianhngannak le rumnak cu, cu khuapi ah cun an rak put lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw a thurhnawmmi cu khi khua chungah ahohmanh an lut kho lai lo; ningzah awk thil a tuahmi hna le lih a chimmi hna zong ahohmanh an lut kho lai lo. Tuufa nunnak cauk chung i an min aa ṭialmi lawnglawng cu khuapi chungah cun an lut kho lai.
  </para>
  <chapter number="22" style="c" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" />Vancungmi nih cun nunnak tiva zong a ka hmuhsak, cu tiva cu Pathian le Tuufa bawiṭhutdan hram in khuapi laifang ah a rung luangmi a si i thlalang bantukin a fiim.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" />Cu tivakam ah cun nunnak thingkung cu a um i kum khat ah voi hleihnih, thla khat ah voi khat lengmang thei a tlai; cun a hnah cu miphun vialte hna caah damnak a si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" />Pathian nih chiat a serhmi thil paohpaoh cu cu khua chungah cun an um kho lai lo. Pathian bawiṭhutdan le Tuufa bawiṭhutdan cu khuapi chungah cun a um lai i a rianṭuantu hna nih khan an biak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" />Annih nih a hmai an hmuh lai i a min cu an cal ah aa ṭial lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" />Zan a um ti lai lo i meiinn siseh, ni ceunak siseh, an herh ti lai lo, zeicahtiah Bawipa Pathian cu an ceunak a si lai i annih cu siangpahrang bantukin uktu zungzal in zungzal tiang an si lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" />Cun vancungmi nih khan a ka thawh i, “Hi bia hi biatak an si i zumhawktlak an si. A Thlarau kha profet hna a petu Bawipa Pathian nih, tuante ah a tlung zau ding thil kha a sal hna hmuhsak awkah, a vanmi kha a run ka thlah,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" />Cun Jesuh nih, “Ngai hmanh, ka ra zau lai. Hi cauk chung i aa ṭialmi profet bia a zulmi cu lunglawmmi an si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" />Keimah Johan nih hi thil vialte hi ka theih hna i ka hmuh hna. Cun ka theih hna i ka hmuh dih hna tikah, hi thil vialte a ka hmuhsaktu vancungmi ke hram ah cun ka bawk i biak ka zalh.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw a ka thawh i, “Tuah hlah. Kei zong nangmah bantukin sal ka si ve ko; na unau profet hna le hi cauk chung i aa ṭialmi bia a zulmi na unau hna bantukin sal ka si ve ko. Pathian tu bia ko,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" />Cun hitihin a ka ti, “Hi cauk chung i aa ṭialmi profet chimchung bia hi a thli in i chiah ko hlah. Zeitintiah hi thil vialte cu a tlin lainak caan a nai cang.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" />Miṭhalo cu ṭhat lonak kha tuah lengmang ko seh, fihnung a simi cu fihnung kha tuah lengmang ko seh, miṭha a simi cu ṭhatnak kha tuah lengmang ko seh, mithiang a simi cu thiannak kha tuah lengmang ko seh,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" />Jesuh nih cun, “Ngaihmanh, ka ra zau lai. Mi kip an rianṭuanning cio ah pek awkah ka laksawng cu ka rak i put lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" />Kei cu Alfa le Omega kha ka si, hmasa bik le hmanung bik, hramthawknak le donghnak ka si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" />An puan kha thiang tein a su i nunnak thingkung theitlai ei khawhnak nawl le khuapi kutka chung luhnak nawl a ngeimi cu lunglawmmi an si.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" />Sihmanhsehlaw uico bantuk a simi hna le eih thiammi hna le horduhcuaimi hna le lainawngmi hna le siasal biami hna le bia in siseh tuahnak in siseh lih a chimmi hna kha cu, khuapi lengah cun an um lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" />“Keimah, Jesuh nih, Khrihfabu chung i a ummi nannih sinah hi bia cu thanh awkah ka vancungmi kha ka run thlah. Kei cu David tefa kha ka si, kei cu deirel arfi ceu cu ka si,” a ti.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" />Thlarau le va ngei laimi ngaknu nih khan, “Ra u,” an ti. Hi bia a theimi paoh nih khan, “Ra u,” ti ve hna seh. Ti a halmi paoh cu ra u, nunnak ti hi a duhmi paoh nih man loin i lak u.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" />Keimah Johan nih hi cauk chung i aa ṭialmi profet bia a theimi paoh kha ralrinnak kan pek hna: hi bia ah ahohmanh nih bia dang a chap ahcun, hi cauk chungah aa ṭialmi hremnak kha a dantatnak ah Pathian nih a chap lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" />Cun hi cauk chung i aa ṭialmi profet bia kha azeihmanh a hlawmi cu, hi cauk chungah aa ṭialmi nunnak thingkung theitlai a co hnga ding le Khua Thiang chung i um venak a co hnga ding cu Pathian nih a lakpiak lai.
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" />Hi thil vialte hi ahmaan dih tiah tehte a khaangtu nih, “Tuan ah ka ra hrimhrim lai,” a ti. Cu bantuk cun si ko seh. Bawipa Jesuh, ra ko cang!
  </para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" />Nan dihlak cungah Bawipa Jesuh vel cu um ko seh. Amen.
  </para>
</usx>
